{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Hey John! How's it going? Hope all is good."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R3-locomo-conv-43/session_29-74e6af0ff1d56bf6d7d9da06", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:24:46.765164+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "74e6af0ff1d56bf6d7d9da06", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "74e6af0ff1d56bf6d7d9da06", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Hey Tim! Things have been good. Something exciting happened recently for me. What about you? How's everything going?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R3-locomo-conv-43/session_29-71f66c26554d1d50ad7cb6e6", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:24:50.957878+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "71f66c26554d1d50ad7cb6e6", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "71f66c26554d1d50ad7cb6e6", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Cool news! I'm trying to get my head around the visa requirements for some places I want to visit. It's kind of overwhelming but I'm excited! What have you been up to?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R3-locomo-conv-43/session_29-4e7667ba1baaff3df71c8313", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:24:55.168411+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4e7667ba1baaff3df71c8313", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4e7667ba1baaff3df71c8313", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Last week was wild - something incredible happened. But it's a total dream come true - just crazy! I got an endorsement with a popular beverage company!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R3-locomo-conv-43/session_29-f821433d82df2fa41d0079fb", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:24:59.304553+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f821433d82df2fa41d0079fb", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f821433d82df2fa41d0079fb", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Congrats! How did it feel to seal the deal?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R3-locomo-conv-43/session_29-289db3644af5808d8a3da4e7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:25:03.655284+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "289db3644af5808d8a3da4e7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "289db3644af5808d8a3da4e7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks! It felt crazy. It's not just about the signing, but it's about feeling like all the hard work paid off - like all those training hours weren't for nothing."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R3-locomo-conv-43/session_29-117c17ca9fb651baf23c6127", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:25:07.791849+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "117c17ca9fb651baf23c6127", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "117c17ca9fb651baf23c6127", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Wow! I bet you were thrilled when everything finally worked out. That sense of accomplishment is awesome and really boosts your self-esteem. I can imagine all the hard work you put into it was definitely worth it."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R3-locomo-conv-43/session_29-d120427839f30e3029f25073", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:25:11.947854+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d120427839f30e3029f25073", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d120427839f30e3029f25073", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yeah, it's great when you reach a goal and it feels rewarding. It's a reminder that you're going in the right direction, and all the hard work was worth it. What's something you feel proud of recently?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R3-locomo-conv-43/session_29-107f27fa4168b005d294d52c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:25:16.124687+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "107f27fa4168b005d294d52c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "107f27fa4168b005d294d52c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: I'm proud of researching visa requirements for countries I want to visit. It feels like taking initiative is a step towards making my travel dreams a reality!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R3-locomo-conv-43/session_29-737eff72eb9ea86069c02beb", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:25:20.275125+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "737eff72eb9ea86069c02beb", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "737eff72eb9ea86069c02beb", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Great going! Taking initiative is a must if you wanna achieve your goals. I'm excited to hear about all your future adventures!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R3-locomo-conv-43/session_29-ee0f3aafcb70327e0fe1d772", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:25:24.492621+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ee0f3aafcb70327e0fe1d772", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ee0f3aafcb70327e0fe1d772", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Thanks! I'll keep you in the loop about my travels. Is there anywhere you recommend visiting?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R3-locomo-conv-43/session_29-29921e7be6078e26441c7ce5", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:25:28.883998+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "29921e7be6078e26441c7ce5", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "29921e7be6078e26441c7ce5", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
